arc-plc/florida/columbia-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 25% of normal in September to October and 18% in October to November. So far in 2026, the middle of the grids shows March to April at 28% of normal and April to May at 108%.</p>"}
